{
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_hunger_drain.description": "維持你的光譜身體是一項艱鉅的任務——你消耗飢餓的速度比正常情況下快 75%。",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_evolved_night_vision.name": "光譜瞄準器",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_evolved_night_vision.description": "你的眼睛能穿透黑暗。",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_evolved_phase.name": "光譜形式（進化）",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_evolved_phase.description": "切換：在定相的同時飛行並穿過堅固的方塊。飢餓消耗減少 25%。黑曜石和基岩仍然會阻擋你。",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_ascended_weakness_aura.name": "可怕的存在",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_ascended_weakness_aura.description": "附近 3 格內的敵人會受到虛弱的影響。",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_ascended_daylight_damage.name": "日光敏感性褪色",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_ascended_daylight_damage.description": "陽光仍然灼熱，但強度減半。",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_apex_phase.name": "光譜形式（頂點）",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_apex_phase.description": "切換：在定相時飛行穿過除基岩之外的所有方塊。飢餓消耗最小。沒有什麼可以容納你。",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_apex_hunger_drain.name": "穩定形式",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_apex_hunger_drain.description": "你的光譜形態已經穩定下來——飢餓感的消耗速度只比正常快 25%。",
  "origins.neoorigins.skeleton.name": "骷髏",
  "origins.neoorigins.skeleton.description": "一袋復活的骨頭－快速、輕盈，用弓致命。身體脆弱，躲避陽光，只能吃最髒的食物。",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_undead.name": "亡靈",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_undead.description": "你是不死族。治療藥水會傷害你，傷害藥水會治療你，而重擊結界會對你造成額外傷害。",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_water_breathing.name": "空心肺",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_water_breathing.description": "不需要呼吸。可以在水下無限期生存。",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_marksmanship.name": "槍法",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_marksmanship.description": "使用投射武器時 +2 額外傷害。",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_speed.name": "骨光",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_speed.description": "您的中空骨頭可讓您的腳步速度加快 20%。",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_jump.name": "輕量級",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_jump.description": "比平常跳高30%。",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_brittle_frame.name": "脆框架",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_brittle_frame.description": "你脆弱的骨骼將你的最大生命值降低至 7 顆心。",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_daylight_damage.name": "太陽曬焦了",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_daylight_damage.description": "除非戴頭盔，否則您會在陽光直射下被灼傷。",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_diet.name": "無骨飲食",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_diet.description": "只能吃骨粉、腐肉、蜘蛛眼。",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_eat_bone_meal.name": "骨骼食慾",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_eat_bone_meal.description": "骨粉對你來說是可以吃的。",
  "origins.neoorigins.slime.name": "史萊姆",
  "origins.neoorigins.slime.description": "一種膠狀生物，必須保持水分才能生存。跌倒時可以無害地彈起，充分濕潤時可以脫離死亡，並且隨著經驗的累積而變得更加堅韌。",
  "power.neoorigins.slime_moisture.name": "水分",
  "power.neoorigins.slime_moisture.description": "您的防潮棒會隨著時間的推移而流失。在沙漠和著火時排水速度更快。站在水中或雨中補充水分。高於 75%：恢復 1。低於 10%：-4 護甲。 0%：你受到傷害。",
  "power.neoorigins.slime_death_save.name": "分割",
  "power.neoorigins.slime_death_save.description": "當你在濕度超過 75% 的情況下死亡時，你會分裂——帶著 2 顆心傳送到 50 個街區之外。你的最大生命值會在 2 分鐘內恢復正常。",
  "power.neoorigins.slime_level_hp.name": "凝膠狀生長",
  "power.neoorigins.slime_level_hp.description": "每 10 級經驗等級 +1 最大生命值。死亡時重置。",
